{"id":"vod_md_6188","vodId":"6188","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修R2","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修R2","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231023-1/33e594daffb6046206f210ffed1959ac.jpg"},"summary":"“东京决战”一年后，布里塔尼亚少年鲁路修在11区（原日本国）过着平凡的学生生活。但是，鲁路修与弟弟罗洛的一次出行，遇到了黑色骑士团的余党。在与少女C.C再次结成契约之后，尘封的记忆摆在了鲁路修的面前。身为帝国王子的鲁路修，为了建立人人平等的世界、让妹妹娜娜丽幸福的世界，而使用GEASS，令人绝对服从的力量，带领黑色骑士团向帝国宣战。带上假面化名ZERO的他，却在一年前的“东京决战”中被好友朱雀击败，被帝国皇帝抹去了记忆。现在，恢复记忆的鲁路修不仅要面对帝国的强大军事力量，更要面对虚假的弟弟罗洛、失踪的妹妹娜娜丽、不知敌友的中华联盟、内部出现分歧的黑色骑士团。面对内忧外患，鲁路修走上了GEASS之力的诅咒——孤独的王之路。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-23 09:07:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/t3pb6MJL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/SXZ2xRu3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/eZhZTQXV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/oyzeLqWj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/2GG9J2CP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/qLcjy4RS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/aDv0YTAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/eCeGA173/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/R3kozC5V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/Vo39jWgX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/jQ1Lv0nF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/67WJ50c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/xANOQZSX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/OOHvw4LJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/202310